1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:03,263
Zameen banjar hai, kheti hoti nahi. Ab kya karun?

2
00:00:03,563 --> 00:00:08,926
Raghav, machhli paalan kar! Biofloc tank mein, taalab ki bhi zaroorat nahi.

3
00:00:09,226 --> 00:00:12,696
Tank mein machhli? Wo zinda kaise rahengi, Das Babu?

4
00:00:12,996 --> 00:00:19,111
Machine se hawa, aur paani mein achhe bacteria. Do tank ka setup, lagbhag 2 lakh.

5
00:00:19,411 --> 00:00:26,493
Matsya Sampada Yojana mein subsidy hai. Bijli ka backup zaroor rakhna, hawa band to machhli khatam.

6
00:00:27,043 --> 00:00:30,814
Raghav beta, bazaar ke liye roz taaza machhli chahiye. Zinda wali!

7
00:00:31,114 --> 00:00:34,306
Seedha tank se, Mausi. 150 rupaye kilo.

8
00:00:34,606 --> 00:00:41,424
Do tank se har 4-5 mahine mein 10 quintal. Daana nikaal kar 75 hazaar se zyada.

9
00:00:41,724 --> 00:00:45,966
Phir tank badha, aur Singhi, Magur jaisi mehngi machhli paal.

10
00:00:46,266 --> 00:00:50,090
Banjar zameen pe machhli ki kheti! Raghav ki life set!
